{"unit_id":"qiyeren__dsh-eac-popup#card-zh","repo":"qiyeren/dsh-eac-popup","commit":"cf9e13b70e9db152c8f9c8254aa3ed2cd2bb9b1a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-eac-popup 是面向 DeepSeek Harness EAC 的 DSH 插件，为 Web 客户端提供会话通知联动。它在 Host 监听提问和审批事件，并通过 HTTP 路由接收外部激活请求；Client 轮询 Host 的会话队列并打开对应会话。主要功能包括提问时将 EAC 窗口置前、审批时触发窗口提示、根据会话 ID 自动切换会话，以及为 EAC 主进程提供激活和队列轮询接口。适合希望及时发现跨会话提问或审批并跳转到对应会话的 EAC 用户。需要 Windows 和 DeepSeek Harness EAC 的 web-desktop 环境；通知弹出联动还需配套主进程补丁。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:83-86","index.mjs:182-225","lib/client.js:11-55"]}
{"unit_id":"qiyeren__dsh-eac-popup#card-en","repo":"qiyeren/dsh-eac-popup","commit":"cf9e13b70e9db152c8f9c8254aa3ed2cd2bb9b1a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-eac-popup links DeepSeek Harness EAC prompts to its web client. The host detects questions and approvals and queues session IDs; the client opens matching sessions. Helps users handle requests across sessions. Requires Windows and EAC web-desktop; notification pop-ups need a main-process patch.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:83-86","index.mjs:182-225","lib/client.js:11-55"]}
